    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "The coordinates of the point P dividing the line segment joining A(1, 3) and B(4, 6) in the ratio 2:1 externally are:",
      "options": {
        "A": "(7, 9)",
        "B": "(6, 8)",
        "C": "(5, 7)",
        "D": "(2, 1)",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "External division: x = (mx2 - nx1)/(m-n) = (2*4 - 1*1)/(2-1) = 7; y = (2*6 - 1*3)/(2-1) = 9.",
      "hash": "7cceb35350562421",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "A(1, 3) और B(4, 6) को जोड़ने वाले रेखाखंड को 2:1 के अनुपात में बाहरी रूप से विभाजित करने वाले बिंदु P के निर्देशांक हैं:",
          "options": {
            "A": "(7, 9)",
            "B": "(6, 8)",
            "C": "(5, 7)",
            "D": "(2, 1)",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "बाहरी विभाजन: x = (mx2 - nx1)/(m-n) = (2*4 - 1*1)/(2-1) = 7; y = (2*6 - 1*3)/(2-1) = 9।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If the area of a triangle with vertices (k, 0), (4, 0) and (0, 2) is 4 square units, then k is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "0",
        "B": "8",
        "C": "0 or 8",
        "D": "4",
        "E": "More than one of the above"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Area = 1/2 |k(0-2) + 4(2-0) + 0(0-0)| = 4 => |-2k + 8| = 8. Either -2k+8 = 8 (k=0) or -2k+8 = -8 (k=8).",
      "hash": "f26152c4b3a663b8",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि शीर्षों (k, 0), (4, 0) और (0, 2) वाले त्रिभुज का क्षेत्रफल 4 वर्ग इकाई है, तो k का मान है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "0",
            "B": "8",
            "C": "0 या 8",
            "D": "4",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से एक से अधिक"
          },
          "explanation": "क्षेत्रफल = 1/2 |k(0-2) + 4(2-0) + 0(0-0)| = 4 => |-2k + 8| = 8। या तो -2k+8 = 8 (k=0) या -2k+8 = -8 (k=8)।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "The coordinates of the point that divides the line segment joining (4, -3) and (8, 5) in the ratio 3:1 internally are:",
      "options": {
        "A": "(7, 3)",
        "B": "(3, 7)",
        "C": "(7, 2)",
        "D": "(2, 7)",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "x = (3*8 + 1*4)/(3+1) = 28/4 = 7; y = (3*5 + 1*-3)/(3+1) = 12/4 = 3.",
      "hash": "e70c06f137b29062",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "(4, -3) और (8, 5) को जोड़ने वाले रेखाखंड को 3:1 के अनुपात में आंतरिक रूप से विभाजित करने वाले बिंदु के निर्देशांक हैं:",
          "options": {
            "A": "(7, 3)",
            "B": "(3, 7)",
            "C": "(7, 2)",
            "D": "(2, 7)",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "x = (3*8 + 1*4)/(3+1) = 28/4 = 7; y = (3*5 + 1*-3)/(3+1) = 12/4 = 3।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-004",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "If the points (1, 2), (0, 0) and (a, b) are collinear, then which relation is true?",
      "options": {
        "A": "a = b",
        "B": "b = 2a",
        "C": "a = 2b",
        "D": "a + b = 0",
        "E": "More than one of the above"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Slope (1,2) to (0,0) is 2/1 = 2. Slope (0,0) to (a,b) is b/a. So b/a = 2 => b = 2a.",
      "hash": "0c7b36bedcd5a00a",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि बिंदु (1, 2), (0, 0) और (a, b) संरेख हैं, तो कौन सा संबंध सत्य है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "a = b",
            "B": "b = 2a",
            "C": "a = 2b",
            "D": "a + b = 0",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से एक से अधिक"
          },
          "explanation": "(1,2) से (0,0) की ढाल 2/1 = 2 है। (0,0) से (a,b) की ढाल b/a है। इसलिए b/a = 2 => b = 2a।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-005",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "The distance of point P(-3, -4) from the x-axis is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "3 units",
        "B": "4 units",
        "C": "5 units",
        "D": "-4 units",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Distance from x-axis is the absolute value of the y-coordinate: |-4| = 4.",
      "hash": "ebe1bab5a58688da",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "बिंदु P(-3, -4) की x-अक्ष से दूरी है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "3 इकाई",
            "B": "4 इकाई",
            "C": "5 इकाई",
            "D": "-4 इकाई",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "x-अक्ष से दूरी y-निर्देशांक का निरपेक्ष मान होती है: |-4| = 4।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "The midpoint of the line segment joining (2a, 4) and (-2, 3b) is (1, 2). Find a and b.",
      "options": {
        "A": "a=2, b=0",
        "B": "a=1, b=1",
        "C": "a=2, b=1",
        "D": "a=0, b=2",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "(2a-2)/2 = 1 => 2a-2=2 => a=2. (4+3b)/2 = 2 => 4+3b=4 => b=0.",
      "hash": "4c06a5ad347e433e",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "(2a, 4) और (-2, 3b) को जोड़ने वाले रेखाखंड का मध्य बिंदु (1, 2) है। a और b ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "a=2, b=0",
            "B": "a=1, b=1",
            "C": "a=2, b=1",
            "D": "a=0, b=2",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "(2a-2)/2 = 1 => 2a-2=2 => a=2। (4+3b)/2 = 2 => 4+3b=4 => b=0।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "The point of intersection of the y-axis and the line 2x + 3y = 6 is:",
      "options": {
