          "question": "y-अक्ष और रेखा 2x + 3y = 6 का प्रतिच्छेदन बिंदु है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "(3, 0)",
            "B": "(0, 2)",
            "C": "(0, 3)",
            "D": "(2, 0)",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "y-अक्ष पर, x=0। 2(0) + 3y = 6 => 3y = 6 => y = 2।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-008",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "The distance between the points (a, b) and (-a, -b) is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "2 sqrt(a^2 + b^2)",
        "B": "sqrt(a^2 + b^2)",
        "C": "2(a + b)",
        "D": "0",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Distance = sqrt((a - (-a))^2 + (b - (-b))^2) = sqrt((2a)^2 + (2b)^2) = 2 sqrt(a^2 + b^2).",
      "hash": "21b34f85ef4df85c",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "बिंदुओं (a, b) और (-a, -b) के बीच की दूरी है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "2 sqrt(a^2 + b^2)",
            "B": "sqrt(a^2 + b^2)",
            "C": "2(a + b)",
            "D": "0",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "दूरी = sqrt((a - (-a))^2 + (b - (-b))^2) = sqrt((2a)^2 + (2b)^2) = 2 sqrt(a^2 + b^2)।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-009",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "If the points A(1, 2), B(0, 0) and C(a, b) form a triangle, its area is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "1/2 |b - 2a|",
        "B": "1/2 |a - 2b|",
        "C": "|b - 2a|",
        "D": "1/2 (a + b)",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Area = 1/2 |x1(y2-y3) + x2(y3-y1) + x3(y1-y2)| = 1/2 |1(0-b) + 0(b-2) + a(2-0)| = 1/2 |-b + 2a|.",
      "hash": "8e154624ec537522",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि बिंदु A(1, 2), B(0, 0) और C(a, b) एक त्रिभुज बनाते हैं, तो इसका क्षेत्रफल है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "1/2 |b - 2a|",
            "B": "1/2 |a - 2b|",
            "C": "|b - 2a|",
            "D": "1/2 (a + b)",
            "E": "उपर्युक्त में से कोई नहीं"
          },
          "explanation": "क्षेत्रफल = 1/2 |1(0-b) + 0(b-2) + a(2-0)| = 1/2 |-b + 2a| = 1/2 |2a - b|।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
