    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-015",
      "number": 15,
      "question": "A line segment is of length 10 units. If one end is (2, -3) and the x-coordinate of the other end is 10, then its y-coordinate is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "3 or -9",
