      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coordinate-geometry-03-017",
      "number": 17,
      "question": "The ratio in which the point (2, y) divides the line segment joining (4, 3) and (6, 3) is:",
      "options": {
        "A": "1:2 externally",
        "B": "1:2 internally",
        "C": "2:1 externally",
        "D": "Not possible",
        "E": "None of the above"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "x = (mx2 + nx1)/(m+n). 2 = (m*6 + n*4)/(m+n) => 2m + 2n = 6m + 4n => -4m = 2n => m/n = -1/2.",
      "hash": "ec01c636111f3790",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "वह अनुपात जिसमें बिंदु (2, y) (4, 3) और (6, 3) को जोड़ने वाले रेखाखंड को विभाजित करता है, वह है:",
          "options": {
            "A": "1:2 बाहरी रूप से",
